As a follow up to my last comment <br><br>Reducing the AF gain to 0xCF stops DMR Rx from working correctly on some radios. Specifically some DM1701 but the same problem may apply to some UV380<br><br>So at the moment we can't release a version with lower AF gain<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Thu Sep 12, 2024 9:20 pm</p><hr />
